{"entry": 4000, "blocks": [
 {"box": [30, 106, 298, 372], "ink": "dark", "text": "To the residents of the Coffin of Kars:\n\n87 adventurers in all set out for your town this time. But there seem to have been landslides in several places, and the caravan following them turned back today.\n\nI don't have the details yet, but I doubt even two in ten will get through. An accident like this is nothing rare, but I worry what it will do to business from here on."}
]},

{"entry": 4001, "blocks": [
 {"box": [36, 130, 290, 360], "ink": "dark", "text": "We will have to review each trading house's share as well, so as soon as things are settled on your end, report as quickly as you can: how many reached you, and how much treasure you were able to send back with the caravans that got through."}
]},

{"entry": 4002, "blocks": [
 {"box": [30, 98, 292, 372], "ink": "dark", "text": "Next, a rundown of events around the world.\n\nFirst, further news on the \"Murder of Duke Mibal.\"\n\nLast autumn Duke Mibal, the second most powerful man in the Kingdom of Racoss, was killed by his own child in the forest on the border between the Kingdom of Racoss and the Republic of Baileste. I believe I have written of this several times by now, but it seems the killer was sighted in the town of Breze two months ago."}
]}
]
